{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_handoff_65_handoff_65", "label": "HANDOFF-65 \u2014 chat 112 to chat 113", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A chat-to-chat handoff for Phase R2 of The Method 1.6: it carries the live bundle ids (BUILD90 main, BUILD141 compendia), the \u00a70 gate, what the closing chat measured, the next section cut, and the standing repair docket, so the successor chat never re-derives and never carries a line number."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_chat_112_unit_l7940_l8028", "label": "Chat 112 unit L7940\u2013L8028 (\u00a729.3\u2013\u00a729.5.5)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L117", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chat 112 took the two sections chat 111 had opened as pointer targets together with the whole Edlen block, so the movement closed in one read rather than splitting a section across chats."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_finding_15l_04", "label": "15l-04 \u2014 docket 16's 1960 against 1964 dating, 29 sites", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L120", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "L8018 declares the chapter a 1960 manuscript cited accordingly; measured across six volumes 1960 has 4 lines against 1964's 25, with no third year, so the declaration fails and docket 16 is six times larger than it was carried."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_finding_15l_05", "label": "15l-05 \u2014 one work, two bibliography entries, two dates, two titles", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L128", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "App F.4.3 L11621 and L11624 are the same Edlen chapter three lines apart, and the second points at the section that declares the 1964 date misleading."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_finding_15l_03", "label": "15l-03 \u2014 Principle 8 cited for a status it does not assign", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L132", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The literal form `Principle N` returns only `Principle 8` in six volumes and chapter 1 carries no numbered list, so a reader cannot resolve which principle is the eighth."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_finding_15l_01", "label": "15l-01 \u2014 inclusive and exclusive page-range conventions four lines apart", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L138", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A six-page review is inclusive and exact for 805\u2013810 while absence from 140 pages is exclusive for 80\u2013220 (141 inclusive): two conventions, each figure with one site."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_finding_15l_02", "label": "15l-02 \u2014 \u00a729.5.1's heading is a false universal against its own status column", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L143", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The body is correct and the heading is the defect, which is why a claim test must exclude the heading line."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_finding_15l_07", "label": "15l-07 \u2014 the carried docket-16 reasoning corrected on measurement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L148", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The finding survives but its reasoning did not: 'sixty-five years old' attaches to the 1960 manuscript at L6676 and is short by one year against a 2026 present, which opens a sweep of every N-years-old statement."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_docket_16", "label": "Docket 16 \u2014 the Edlen dating and its declaration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L120", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_r2_ch15t", "label": "r2-ch15t \u2014 chat 113's computable instrument", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L228", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_r2_ch15u", "label": "r2-ch15u \u2014 chat 113's prose instrument", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L228", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_r2lib", "label": "r2lib \u2014 the shared resolver library", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L228", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Resolvers are imported by path and never copied, so a repair to one lands everywhere; body_range, a digit-bounded numeral sweep, the two-line-join phrase sweep, a grouped-aware register lookup, a left-bounded stem matcher and a raw symbol test are the functions still owed to it."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_read_ch15l", "label": "READ-ch15l.md \u2014 chat 112's section-read member", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L119", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_section_0_gate", "label": "\u00a70 Gate \u2014 bundle fetch, bootstrap, census, core, manifest, cert", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L62", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each step is its own tool call under `timeout 280` and any FAIL stops the chat with a report, because the gate is what makes every later measurement attributable to a named byte count and md5 rather than to memory."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_repair_docket", "label": "The repair docket \u2014 the standing R3 list", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L234", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Carried forward until R3 executes it; none of it goes to M, because a finding is recorded and flagged, never put to the author as a question."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_book_present_2026", "label": "The book's present is 2026", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L49", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Measured: 2025 has zero main-volume sites and 2026 has twelve, so every age statement in the volumes is computed against 2026."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_defect_census_member_key", "label": "DEFECT-CENSUS.tsv is keyed on `member`, never on a filename", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L33", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The member column's values are mc, all, main, reg, ioi, pc and sc; keying on a filename silently returns zero rows, so a zero must be witnessed against the nearest rows either side."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_has_token_bounding", "label": "has_token is letter-bounded on both sides", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L38", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A stem scores zero on every inflected form, so a stem test must be left-bounded only and a symbol tested raw."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_65_channel_table_arbiter", "label": "The channel table as arbiter for every species figure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L203", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Section II of the spectra member, L293\u2013L934, totals at L900; every parse is bound to that span and checked against the totals line before a figure is trusted."}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_handoff_65_handoff_65", "target": "recovered_handoff_65_chat_112_unit_l7940_l8028", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L117", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_handoff_65_finding_15l_04", "target": "recovered_handoff_65_chat_112_unit_l7940_l8028", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L117", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_handoff_65_read_ch15l", "target": "recovered_handoff_65_finding_15l_04", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L119", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_handoff_65_finding_15l_05", "target": "recovered_handoff_65_chat_112_unit_l7940_l8028", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L117", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_handoff_65_read_ch15l", "target": "recovered_handoff_65_finding_15l_05", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-65.md", "source_location": "L119", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_handoff_65_finding_15l_03", "target": "recovered_handoff_65_chat_112_unit_l7940_l8028", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_fi